It is morning time in Mumbai.
My room is very quiet.
I wake up early.
I go into the kitchen.
I make fresh coffee for myself.
The aroma of the coffee is very nice.
I stand near the window.
I drink the coffee slowly.
Today is a workday.
I get ready for the office.
I take my laptop bag.
I put my laptop in the bag.
I look for my wallet and house keys.
The keys and wallet are on the table.
I put them in the bag.
I step out of the house.
I close the door of the house.
I lock the door.
I leave for the office now.
